# AI Equity Research Agent

Production-style portfolio project for explainable US equity research using
provider abstractions, deterministic scoring, LangGraph workflows, SEC filing
RAG, evidence-backed deep research, and a deployable dashboard.

## Current status

- Phase 0: Architecture complete
- Phase 1: FastAPI foundation complete
- Phase 2: Market Data Provider complete
- Phase 3: Financial Data and Explainable Scoring in progress

## Architecture

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    UI["Next.js Dashboard"] --> API["FastAPI"]
    API --> SERVICE["Application Services"]
    SERVICE --> AGENT["LangGraph Workflows"]
    SERVICE --> PROVIDER["Provider Registry"]
    PROVIDER --> MARKET["Market Data"]
    PROVIDER --> FUNDAMENTALS["SEC Company Facts"]
    PROVIDER --> NEWS["News Provider"]
    PROVIDER --> SEC["SEC EDGAR"]
    SERVICE --> SCORE["Deterministic Scoring"]
    SERVICE --> POSTGRES[("PostgreSQL")]
    SEC --> QDRANT[("Qdrant")]
    AGENT --> REDIS["Redis Queue"]
    REDIS --> WORKER["Research Worker"]
```

## Local development

Phase 1-8 development runs natively on the workstation. Docker Compose is
reserved for the Linux VPS deployment phase.

```powershell
py -3.12 -m venv .venv
.venv\Scripts\python.exe -m pip install -e "backend[dev]"
.venv\Scripts\python.exe -m uvicorn app.main:app --app-dir backend --reload
```

Default mode is deterministic Mock data:

```text
DATA_MODE=mock
```

API documentation:

- http://127.0.0.1:8000/docs
- http://127.0.0.1:8000/redoc

## API currently available

```text
GET /health
GET /api/stocks/{ticker}
```

Example:

```powershell
Invoke-RestMethod http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/stocks/NVDA
```

## Testing

```powershell
.venv\Scripts\python.exe -m pytest
.venv\Scripts\ruff.exe check backend\app backend\tests
.venv\Scripts\mypy.exe backend\app
```

Tests use Mock Providers and local HTTP transports. Real-provider tests are
opt-in and require the relevant environment variable and API key.

